    "questions_answered_QRpy8g": {
      "type": "questions_answered",
      "name": "FAQ Accordion",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Questions Answered",
        "heading_white": "Everything You",
        "heading_gold": "Need",
        "heading_white_2": "to Know",
        "question_1": "How do AIWO Fast Bars support intermittent fasting?",
        "answer_1": "AIWO Fast Bars are designed with a carefully balanced macronutrient profile that provides essential nutrition during your eating window without disrupting the metabolic state achieved during fasting. With only 200 calories and ingredients that don't interfere with ketogenesis, they help you maintain nutritional adequacy while practicing time-restricted eating.",
        "question_2": "What makes these bars different from regular protein bars?",
        "answer_2": "Unlike many commercial bars loaded with added sugars, artificial flavors, and fillers, AIWO Fast Bars use whole-food ingredients: premium nuts (almonds, cashews, pecans), seeds, natural sweeteners (brown rice syrup, honey), and functional additions like chicory powder for prebiotic fibre. Our formulation is informed by research on fasting physiology.",
        "question_3": "How many bars should I eat per day?",
        "answer_3": "For most individuals practicing intermittent fasting, 1-2 bars per day is appropriate, consumed during your eating window. Common usage patterns include breaking your fast with one bar, pre/post-workout nutrition, or as a convenient snack option during busy days. Always consume as part of a balanced, varied diet.",
        "question_4": "",
        "answer_4": "",
        "question_5": "Can I eat these bars if I'm not fasting?",
        "answer_5": "Absolutely! While formulated with intermittent fasting in mind, AIWO Fast Bars are versatile nutrition bars suitable for anyone seeking convenient, wholesome nutrition. They work well as on the go snack replacements, pre/post-workout snacks, office nutrition, or travel food.",
        "question_6": "How should I store my Fast Bars?",
        "answer_6": "Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight and heat (ideally below 25°C). After opening the package, reseal it properly for optimal freshness and quality. Proper storage prevents moisture absorption and maintains the texture and flavor of the nuts and dark chocolate drizzle.",
